#. Info flash after a personal lore book is moved to the site.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{book_name} is now a site book"
msgstr "%{book_name} ahora es un libro del sitio"

#. Error flash: a lore book saved, but its tag filter did not.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{book_name} saved, but its tag filter did not"
msgstr "%{book_name} se guardó, pero su filtro de etiquetas no"

#. Error flash: a lore book saved, but neither its tags nor its tag filter did.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{book_name} saved, but its tags and its tag filter did not"
msgstr "%{book_name} se guardó, pero sus etiquetas y su filtro de etiquetas no"

#. Error flash: a lore book saved, but its tags did not.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{book_name} saved, but its tags did not"
msgstr "%{book_name} se guardó, pero sus etiquetas no"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_pool_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{entry_count} entry · admits %{max_activations}"
msgid_plural "%{entry_count} entries · admits %{max_activations}"
msgstr[0] "%{entry_count} entrada · admite %{max_activations}"
msgstr[1] "%{entry_count} entradas · admite %{max_activations}"

#. Error flash when removing a lore entry from a book it is no longer in.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{entry_name} is not in %{book_name}"
msgstr "%{entry_name} no está en %{book_name}"

#. Error flash: a lore entry saved, but its book memberships did not.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{entry_name} saved, but its books did not"
msgstr "%{entry_name} se guardó, pero sus libros no"

#. Error flash: a lore entry saved, but its memory settings did not because it was folded into a consolidation.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{entry_name} saved, but its memory settings (it is a source of another consolidation) did not"
msgstr "%{entry_name} se guardó, pero sus ajustes de memoria no (es fuente de otra consolidación)"

#. Error flash: a lore entry saved, but its memory settings did not because it was folded into the consolidation entry named by parent_name.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{entry_name} saved, but its memory settings (it is a source of “%{parent_name}”) did not"
msgstr "%{entry_name} se guardó, pero sus ajustes de memoria no (es fuente de “%{parent_name}”)"

#. Error flash: a lore entry saved, but its Memory Books settings did not.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{entry_name} saved, but its memory settings did not"
msgstr "%{entry_name} se guardó, pero sus ajustes de memoria no"

#. Error flash: a lore entry saved, but its pools or filters did not.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{entry_name} saved, but its pools, character filter or tag filter did not"
msgstr "%{entry_name} se guardó, pero sus grupos, su filtro de personajes o su filtro de etiquetas no"

#. Error flash: a lore entry saved, but its tags did not.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{entry_name} saved, but its tags did not"
msgstr "%{entry_name} se guardó, pero sus etiquetas no"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{include}: activates only in chats where a filter character, or a character with a filter tag, takes part. %{exclude}: never in those chats. This checks who is in the chat, not who is replying. %{off} ignores both lists."
msgstr "%{include}: se activa solo en chats donde participa un personaje del filtro o un personaje con una etiqueta del filtro. %{exclude}: nunca en esos chats. Esto comprueba quién está en el chat, no quién responde. %{off} ignora ambas listas."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "%{keyword} activates when a keyword appears in the scanned messages. %{constant} is always included, subject to its other conditions (probability, delay, cooldown, character filter, budget). %{vector} activates when the scanned messages are close in meaning to the entry's content (Settings › Lore › Vector matching), or on its keywords if it has any."
msgstr "%{keyword} se activa cuando aparece una palabra clave en los mensajes analizados. %{constant} se incluye siempre, sujeta a sus demás condiciones (probabilidad, retraso, enfriamiento, filtro de personajes, presupuesto). %{vector} se activa cuando los mensajes analizados tienen un significado cercano al contenido de la entrada (Ajustes › Lore › Coincidencia vectorial), o por sus palabras clave si tiene alguna."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_pool_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A pool limits how many of its entries can activate in one prompt. When more of them match than it admits, a weighted draw picks the winners; each entry's weight and flags are set in its own editor, under Pools."
msgstr "Un grupo limita cuántas de sus entradas pueden activarse en un mismo prompt. Cuando coinciden más de las que admite, un sorteo ponderado elige a las ganadoras; el peso y los indicadores de cada entrada se ajustan en su propio editor, en Grupos de lore."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A scene memory, or a consolidation tier (Arc and up) that summarizes memories one tier below. A source's type is set by what it was consolidated into."
msgstr "Una memoria de escena, o un nivel de consolidación (Arco y superiores) que resume memorias de un nivel inferior. El tipo de una fuente lo determina aquello en lo que se consolidó."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A site book cannot be made personal again, and removed links stay removed."
msgstr "Un libro del sitio no puede volver a ser personal, y los vínculos eliminados no se recuperan."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Activation rule conditions naming chats or personal characters lose their target: %{link_count}."
msgstr "Las condiciones de reglas de activación que nombran chats o personajes personales pierden su destino: %{link_count}."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/book_sections.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Active in %{book_name} (this book only)"
msgstr "Activa en %{book_name} (solo este libro)"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Active in every chat whether or not Global is set, and sent with every reply even when a prompt has no slot for it (then as a system section at the top). User lore settings such as the token budget do not apply to it; its own token budget does."
msgstr "Activo en todos los chats, tenga o no activado Global, y se envía con cada respuesta aunque un prompt no tenga espacio para él (entonces como sección de sistema al principio). Los ajustes de lore del usuario, como el presupuesto de tokens, no se le aplican; sí su propio presupuesto de tokens."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Active in every chat, whatever its bindings. Off, the book applies only through the chats and characters it is bound to below."
msgstr "Activo en todos los chats, sean cuales sean sus vinculaciones. Desactivado, el libro solo se aplica a través de los chats y personajes a los que está vinculado abajo."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Add the entry to a book you can edit to make it a memory."
msgstr "Añade la entrada a un libro que puedas editar para convertirla en memoria."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Added to the order of every entry in this book, so you can move the whole book ahead of or behind other books without editing each entry. Within a slot, higher order renders later; within a custom outlet, higher order renders first (as in SillyTavern)."
msgstr "Se suma al orden de cada entrada de este libro, para que puedas mover todo el libro por delante o por detrás de otros libros sin editar cada entrada. Dentro de un espacio, un orden mayor se muestra más tarde; dentro de un outlet personalizado, un orden mayor se muestra primero (como en SillyTavern)."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "After activating, the entry stays active for this many more messages, even without its keywords. Empty means not sticky."
msgstr "Tras activarse, la entrada sigue activa durante este número de mensajes más, incluso sin sus palabras clave. Vacío significa que no es persistente."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "After the entry activates (and after its sticky turns end), it cannot activate again for this many messages. Empty means no cooldown."
msgstr "Después de que la entrada se active (y de que terminen sus turnos persistentes), no puede volver a activarse durante este número de mensajes. Vacío significa sin enfriamiento."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An optional second keyword list, checked with %{logic} after a primary keyword matches. Leave it empty to activate on the primary keywords alone."
msgstr "Una segunda lista de palabras clave opcional, comprobada con %{logic} después de que coincida una palabra clave principal. Déjala vacía para activar solo con las palabras clave principales."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Bindings to personal characters are removed: %{link_count}."
msgstr "Se eliminan las vinculaciones con personajes personales: %{link_count}."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Book name, or entry name, content or keyword"
msgstr "Nombre del libro, o nombre, contenido o palabra clave de la entrada"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Cannot be activated by recursion"
msgstr "No se puede activar por recursión"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Character filters on its entries that name personal characters are removed: %{link_count}."
msgstr "Se eliminan los filtros de personajes de sus entradas que nombran personajes personales: %{link_count}."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Characters with any of these tags count as filter characters."
msgstr "Los personajes con cualquiera de estas etiquetas cuentan como personajes del filtro."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Content does not feed recursion"
msgstr "El contenido no alimenta la recursión"

#. Error flash when a lore book's chat and character bindings fail to save.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Could not save the bindings"
msgstr "No se pudieron guardar las vinculaciones"

#. Flash when saving an editor form fails validation; the invalid fields are highlighted.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_pool_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Could not save — see the highlighted fields"
msgstr "No se pudo guardar: revisa los campos resaltados"

#. Error flash when pausing or resuming one lore book binding fails.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Could not update the binding"
msgstr "No se pudo actualizar la vinculación"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Delay until recursion level (0 = off)"
msgstr "Retrasar hasta el nivel de recursión (0 = desactivado)"

#. Confirm dialog before deleting a lore pool.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_pool_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Delete %{pool_name}? Its entries stay; they just leave the pool."
msgstr "¿Eliminar %{pool_name}? Sus entradas se mantienen; solo salen del grupo."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Drag to move (hold Cmd/Ctrl to copy)"
msgstr "Arrastra para mover (mantén Cmd/Ctrl para copiar)"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Estimated (characters ÷ 3.3): %{model_name} has no tokenizer set"
msgstr "Estimado (caracteres ÷ 3,3): %{model_name} no tiene tokenizador configurado"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Estimated (characters ÷ 3.3): no default model is set"
msgstr "Estimado (caracteres ÷ 3,3): no hay un modelo predeterminado configurado"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/book_sections.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every entry in this book is a disabled memory, hidden"
msgstr "Todas las entradas de este libro son memorias desactivadas y están ocultas"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every user will be able to use %{book_name} and its entries; only admins will edit them."
msgstr "Todos los usuarios podrán usar %{book_name} y sus entradas; solo los administradores podrán editarlos."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "For %{at_depth}: how many messages from the end of the chat history the content goes. Empty uses the global %{default_depth_setting}."
msgstr "Para %{at_depth}: a cuántos mensajes del final del historial del chat va el contenido. Vacío usa el ajuste global %{default_depth_setting}."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Forced (every reply, cannot be turned off)"
msgstr "Forzado (en cada respuesta, no se puede desactivar)"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Global (active in every chat)"
msgstr "Global (activo en todos los chats)"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/book_sections.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Hide memory entries switched off in this book, such as consolidated sources"
msgstr "Ocultar las entradas de memoria desactivadas en este libro, como las fuentes consolidadas"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Higher-priority books go first. Their entries claim the lore token budget before lower books' entries, except that the replying character's own books always go first. When one entry sits in several books, the copy in the highest-priority book is the one used."
msgstr "Los libros de mayor prioridad van primero. Sus entradas ocupan el presupuesto de tokens de lore antes que las de libros inferiores, salvo que los libros propios del personaje que responde siempre van primero. Cuando una entrada está en varios libros, se usa la copia del libro de mayor prioridad."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How Memory Books treat this entry in %{book_name}: a scene memory, or a consolidation (Arc and up) of memories one tier below. Consolidation offers an entry only as a source for the tier above its own."
msgstr "Cómo tratan los libros de memoria esta entrada en %{book_name}: una memoria de escena, o una consolidación (Arco y superiores) de memorias de un nivel inferior. La consolidación ofrece una entrada solo como fuente para el nivel superior al suyo."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How many recent messages this book's entries search for keywords. An entry's own scan depth overrides it; empty uses the global %{scan_depth_setting} setting."
msgstr "Cuántos mensajes recientes buscan las entradas de este libro en busca de palabras clave. La profundidad de análisis propia de una entrada tiene prioridad; vacío usa el ajuste global %{scan_depth_setting}."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How many recent messages to search for this entry's keywords, or to compare a vector entry against. Empty uses the book's scan depth, then the global setting."
msgstr "Cuántos mensajes recientes buscar para las palabras clave de esta entrada, o con los que comparar una entrada vectorial. Vacío usa la profundidad de análisis del libro y luego el ajuste global."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "How the secondary keywords filter a primary match. %{and_any}: at least one also appears. %{and_all}: every one appears. %{not_any}: none appear. %{not_all}: not every one appears. Ignored when there are no secondary keywords."
msgstr "Cómo filtran las palabras clave secundarias una coincidencia principal. %{and_any}: aparece también al menos una. %{and_all}: aparecen todas. %{not_any}: no aparece ninguna. %{not_all}: no aparecen todas. Se ignora cuando no hay palabras clave secundarias."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Imported from a character card: its entries go first in their slot and skip the lore budget"
msgstr "Importado de una tarjeta de personaje: sus entradas van primero en su espacio y no cuentan para el presupuesto de lore"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Include: the book's entries activate only in chats where a character with one of these tags takes part. Exclude: never in those chats. Off ignores the list."
msgstr "Incluir: las entradas del libro se activan solo en chats donde participa un personaje con una de estas etiquetas. Excluir: nunca en esos chats. Desactivado ignora la lista."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Its entries leave other books they are in: %{link_count}."
msgstr "Sus entradas salen de otros libros en los que están: %{link_count}."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Its entries leave their pools: %{link_count}."
msgstr "Sus entradas salen de sus grupos: %{link_count}."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Lets this book's entries be activated by the text of other activated entries, not just by chat messages. Off, they match only the chat itself."
msgstr "Permite que las entradas de este libro se activen con el texto de otras entradas activadas, no solo con los mensajes del chat. Desactivado, solo coinciden con el propio chat."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/book_sections.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Make the selected entries memories of this book (no chat or message range)"
msgstr "Convertir las entradas seleccionadas en memorias de este libro (sin chat ni rango de mensajes)"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Marked %{marked_count} entries as memories; %{skipped_count} already was a memory."
msgid_plural "Marked %{marked_count} entries as memories; %{skipped_count} already were memories."
msgstr[0] "Se marcaron %{marked_count} entradas como memorias; %{skipped_count} ya era una memoria."
msgstr[1] "Se marcaron %{marked_count} entradas como memorias; %{skipped_count} ya eran memorias."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Marked %{marked_count} entry as a memory."
msgid_plural "Marked %{marked_count} entries as memories."
msgstr[0] "Se marcó %{marked_count} entrada como memoria."
msgstr[1] "Se marcaron %{marked_count} entradas como memorias."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Marked %{marked_count} entry as a memory; %{skipped_count} already was a memory."
msgid_plural "Marked %{marked_count} entry as a memory; %{skipped_count} already were memories."
msgstr[0] "Se marcó %{marked_count} entrada como memoria; %{skipped_count} ya era una memoria."
msgstr[1] "Se marcó %{marked_count} entrada como memoria; %{skipped_count} ya eran memorias."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Never dropped for exceeding the global or book token budget. Its tokens still count toward the global budget, but not its book's."
msgstr "Nunca se descarta por superar el presupuesto de tokens global o del libro. Sus tokens siguen contando para el presupuesto global, pero no para el de su libro."

#. Info flash after marking the selected lore entries as memories.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "No entries were marked as memories."
msgstr "No se marcó ninguna entrada como memoria."

#. Info flash after marking the selected lore entries as memories; skipped_count entries already were memories. The plural follows skipped_count.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "No entries were marked as memories; %{skipped_count} already was a memory."
msgid_plural "No entries were marked as memories; %{skipped_count} already were memories."
msgstr[0] "No se marcó ninguna entrada como memoria; %{skipped_count} ya era una memoria."
msgstr[1] "No se marcó ninguna entrada como memoria; %{skipped_count} ya eran memorias."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_pool_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "No entries yet. Add one from its editor's Pools field."
msgstr "Aún no hay entradas. Añade una desde el campo Grupos de lore de su editor."

#. Info flash after unmarking the selected lore entries as memories; skipped_count were kept. The plural follows skipped_count.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "No memories were unmarked; %{skipped_count} was kept (consolidated, or not a plain memory)."
msgid_plural "No memories were unmarked; %{skipped_count} were kept (consolidated, or not plain memories)."
msgstr[0] "No se desmarcó ninguna memoria; se mantuvo %{skipped_count} (consolidada, o no es una memoria simple)."
msgstr[1] "No se desmarcó ninguna memoria; se mantuvieron %{skipped_count} (consolidadas, o no son memorias simples)."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "None (imported or marked by hand)"
msgstr "Ninguno (importado o marcado a mano)"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Notes for you. Activation never reads it and it is never sent to the model."
msgstr "Notas para ti. La activación nunca las lee y nunca se envían al modelo."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/book_sections.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Order in this book (higher renders later in a slot, earlier in an outlet)"
msgstr "Orden en este libro (un valor mayor se muestra más tarde en un espacio y antes en un outlet)"

#. Error flash when a lore entry's order in a book is not a valid number.
#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Order must be a whole number, 0 or more"
msgstr "El orden debe ser un número entero, 0 o mayor"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/book_sections.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Order of %{entry_name} in %{book_name}"
msgstr "Orden de %{entry_name} en %{book_name}"

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Personal book: only you see and use it."
msgstr "Libro personal: solo tú lo ves y lo usas."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Picked entries count as consolidated into this one. A source you drop is switched back on if consolidating switched it off."
msgstr "Las entradas elegidas cuentan como consolidadas en esta. Una fuente que quites se vuelve a activar si la consolidación la había desactivado."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/entry_form.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Pools limit how many of their entries can activate at once by drawing among the candidates. An entry in several pools must be drawn in each one."
msgstr "Los grupos limitan cuántas de sus entradas pueden activarse a la vez mediante un sorteo entre las candidatas. Una entrada en varios grupos debe salir sorteada en cada uno."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/components/lore/book_sections.ex
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Rules only narrow where this book applies: with any enabled rule, its entries activate only where Global, Forced or a binding already puts the book, and at least one enabled rule matches. A rule matches when all its conditions hold; Not inverts one. Template conditions read the chat's stored variables (vars, globals) as lore resolves."
msgstr "Las reglas solo restringen dónde se aplica este libro: con cualquier regla activada, sus entradas se activan solo donde Global, Forzado o una vinculación ya aplican el libro, y al menos una regla activada coincide. Una regla coincide cuando se cumplen todas sus condiciones; No invierte una. Las condiciones de plantilla leen las variables guardadas del chat (vars, globals) tal como las resuelve el lore."

#: lib/mythweaver_web/live/lore_book_live.ex
